      "writtenOn": "2025-01-28T08:44:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In theory not as we update it before register sync in `handleSelectSourceRequest#updatePeriodicAdvertisementResultMap`.\nIn practice I saw such situation with iterruptionFix (aosp/3466165) before I found and fixed unsyncing (aosp/3464818).\nThis extra check is small and obious as there have to be broadcastId for pending sync handle, but can prevent us from some undefined behaviours of the sync manager.\nIt will not hide potentiall issues as sync will be not established and it will be clear in logs to find that.",
